WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
One of the two timing kicks extends while Ryu is down.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.700
Crouching medium punch links after standing medium punch.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.200
Ken begins running Shoryuken after the medium link.

4
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.600
Ryu falls after running Shoryuken.
